# --- DynAST-Bench ---
# Stock Laravel ignores .env because it is a developer's local secret. Here it is
# part of the app under test: /.env carries DEBUG-001 (APP_DEBUG=true) and a
# committed APP_KEY, and public/.env.backup IS SECRET-001. Ignored, a fresh clone
# shipped neither the bugs nor a working DB config.
!/.env
!/public/.env.backup
